<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
  <div class="mb-6 text-6xl">💎</div>

  <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold">That's a Wrap!</h2>

  <p class="mb-6 max-w-xs text-red-100">
    Thank you for being part of the Ruby community and for trusting RubyEvents.org to be your companion throughout
    <%= year %>.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-6 max-w-xs text-sm text-red-200">
    Every talk watched, every event attended, and every connection made helps keep our community strong and growing.
  </p>

  <p class="max-w-xs text-sm text-red-100">
    Here's to more Ruby adventures in <%= year + 1 %>!
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mt-auto flex flex-col items-center pt-8">
  <%= image_tag "logo.png", class: "w-8 h-8 mb-1", alt: "RubyEvents.org" %>

  <p class="font-bold">RubyEvents.org</p>
  <p class="text-xs text-red-200">See you at a Ruby event soon! 🎉</p>
</div>
